4. Architectural Instantiation

4.1 The Five Planes

· Plane 5 — Institutional Plane. Legitimacy predicate $\Lambda: \mathcal{G} \to \{\top, \bot\}$, constitutional constraints, emergency powers.
· Plane 4 — Governance Plane. Policy lifecycle, authority registry, governance state machine, governance receipts.
