║   ════════════════                                                           ║
║                                                                              ║
║        G_eff(z, ξ)  ∈ R^p        (effective capacity)                        ║
║        G_req(z)     ∈ R^p        (requirement)                               ║
║                                                                              ║
║        Φ_min(G_eff, G_req) = min_k (G_eff^k / G_req^k) - 1                  ║
║                                                                              ║
║        Q(z) = Φ_min(G_eff(z), G_req(z))                                      ║
║                                                                              ║
║   SETS:                                                                      ║
║   ═════                                                                      ║
║                                                                              ║
║        S = { X ∈ X^G : Q(X) ≥ 0 }                    (governable set)        ║
║                                                                              ║
║        Viab_{F_G}(S) = { X ∈ S : ∃ π ∀t≥0: X_t^π ∈ S }  (viability kernel)  ║
║                                                                              ║
║   DYNAMICS:                                                                  ║
║   ═════════                                                                  ║
║                                                                              ║
║        X_{t+1}^G = F_G( X_t^G, u_t, e_t )                                    ║
║                                                                              ║
║        u_t ∈ U(X_t, e_t)      (admissible control)                           ║
║        e_t ∈ E(X_t)            (admissible evidence)                         ║
║                                                                              ║
║   SENSITIVITY:                                                               ║
║   ════════════                                                               ║
║                                                                              ║
║        E_G(v; z) = D_v G_eff(z)     (Gâteaux derivative on Z)               ║
║        E_req(v; z) = D_v G_req(z)                                            ║
║                                                                              ║
║        Weighted subgradient condition:                                       ║
║                                                                              ║
║          ⟨g_eff, E_G⟩ + ⟨g_req, E_req⟩ ≥ 0                                   ║
║                                                                              ║
║        where g_eff ∈ ∂_{G_eff} Φ_min,  g_req ∈ ∂_{G_req} Φ_min             ║
║                                                                              ║
║   TIMING:                                                                    ║
║   ═══════                                                                    ║
║                                                                              ║
║        GWM = H(z,E) - D(G,E) - I(G,E)                                        ║
║                                                                              ║
║        GWM > 0   ⟺   T_H > T_D + T_I                                         ║
║                                                                              ║
║   CRYPTOGRAPHIC:                                                             ║
║   ══════════════                                                             ║
║                                                                              ║
║        g_t = ⟨ m_t, σ_t ⟩,  σ_t = Sign_{sk_I}(m_t)                          ║
║                                                                              ║
║        Valid at t'  ⟺  Verify_{pk_I}(m_t, σ_t) = 1                          ║
║                        ∧ epoch_t > epoch_prev                                ║
║                        ∧ |timestamp_t - t'| ≤ Δ_fresh                        ║
║                                                                              ║
║        Pr[ forge ] ≤ negl(λ)   (EUF-CMA + HSM)                               ║
║                                                                              ║
